        "layout": "stack",
        "style": "raised",
        "text": "<p>DRAFT — needs Albert's confirmation before turning on.</p><ul><li>I look at every card out of its sleeve, front and back, under a bright light.</li><li>I tilt every holo to look for scratches.</li><li>The photos on each listing show the exact card you'll receive.</li><li>I condition raw cards using TCGplayer's standard.</li></ul>"
